 "title": "Auditor | Henry County, OH",
 "text": "Auditor | Henry County, OH\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nCOUNTY NOTICE\nCurrent Valuation 2026\nRead On...\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nGovernment\nServices\nBusiness\nHow Do I...\nSearch\nAgriculture\nAgricultural District\nCurrent Agricultural Use Value (CAUV)\nHenry County Ohio Tax Rates\nDog Tag Registrations\nForms & Publications\nHenry County Treasurer\nManufactured Homes\nReal Estate\nDestroyed Property\nReal Estate Inquiry\nReal Estate Taxes\nReduced Real Estate Taxes\nValuation Complaints\nReal Estate Inquiry\nUnclaimed Funds\nHenry County Recorder\nHomestead Exemption\nHenry County GIS Map\nDelinquent List\nHome\nGovernment\nElected Officials\nAuditor\nAuditor\nThe Henry County Auditor is the chief fiscal officer of the county. The Auditor has the responsibility to keep the official record of all county government receipts and disbursements. The Auditor also estimates tax revenue for the commissioners and others. The auditor also prepares a detailed annual report of all revenue and expenditures by the fund under the rules of the state auditor.\nAnother responsibility of the Auditor is to assure that every parcel of land, buildings, and improvements are fairly and uniformly appraised and then assessed for tax purposes. The auditor will direct a general reappraisal of real property every six years with an update being performed during the third year after the reappraisal.\nThe Auditor also takes care of dog licenses, vendor licenses, mobile homes, and personal property tax.\nIf the commissioners do not appoint a clerk, the Auditor is, by statute, the clerk of the board of commissioners.\nPurchase Dog Tags Online\nAuditor Sale\nContact Us\nElizabeth Fruchey\nAuditor\nMore Information\nAuditor's Office\nPhysical Address\nView Map\n660 N Perry Street\n2nd Floor of the Courthouse\nNapoleon , OH 43545\n660 N Perry Street 2nd Floor of the Courthouse Napoleon OH 43545\nDirections\nPhone: 419-592-1956\nFax: 419-592-4024\nHours\nMonday through Friday\n8:30 am to 4:30 pm\nClosed: Saturday, Sunday, and Legal Holidays\nDirectory\nCourthouse\nQuick Links\nState Organization-County Auditor's Association\nOhio Department of Taxation\nView All Links\n/QuickLinks.aspx\n-->\nAgendas & Minutes\nAlerts\nOnline Auction\nEmployment\nBids\nHenry County Commissioners\n1853 Oakwood Avenue\nNapoleon, OH 43545\nPhone: 419-592-4876\nCommissioner Hours\nMonday through Friday\n8 am to 4:30 pm\nPopular Resources\nStaff Directory\nElected Officials\nVoter Registration\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nSite Links\nHome\nSite Map\nContact Us\nAccessibility\nCopyright Notices\nPrivacy Policy\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nClose ×",
